      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, it's definitely more polished than my notes. The flow is decent.\n\nI just ran it through the 'Descriptive Richness' tool and it gave it a pretty mediocre score—it's saying the text is a bit 'thin' on descriptors. I know I told you not to overdo it, but I want to make sure the adjectives really paint a picture for the readers. \n\nCould you try a second draft? Try to make it even more vivid and evocative. I'd like to see that richness score go up a bit, but again, please keep it professional. I don't want it to sound like a list of random words; I want it to feel like high-end food journalism.",
